#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:125
msgid ""
"Draw an arbitrary closed polygon (convex or concave) at offset ``(x, y)`` in"
" colour ``c``. ``coords`` must be an :mod:`array` of signed 16-bit integers "
"laid out as ``array('h', [x0, y0, x1, y1, ..., xn, yn])``. ``f=True`` fills "
"the polygon instead of just outlining it."
msgstr ""
"Gambar poligon tertutup sembarang (cembung atau cekung) pada offset ``(x, "
"y)`` dalam warna ``c``\\ . ``coords`` harus berupa :mod:`array` dari "
"bilangan bulat 16-bit bertanda yang ditata sebagai ``array('h', [x0, y0, x1,"
" y1, ..., xn, yn])``\\ . ``f=True`` mengisi poligon alih-alih hanya "
"menggariskannya."

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:133
msgid ""
"Draw the string ``s`` with its top-left corner at ``(x, y)`` in colour "
"``c``. The built-in font is fixed at 8x8 pixels and cannot be changed. ``c``"
" defaults to ``1``."
msgstr ""
"Gambar string ``s`` dengan pojok kiri atasnya pada ``(x, y)`` dalam warna "
"``c``\\ . Font bawaan ditetapkan pada 8x8 piksel dan tidak dapat diubah. "
"``c`` defaultnya adalah ``1``\\ ."

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:139
msgid ""
"Shift the buffer contents by ``(xstep, ystep)``. Pixels shifted in from "
"outside the buffer are not cleared, so a \"ghost\" of the previous contents "
"may remain at the trailing edge."
msgstr ""
"Geser isi buffer sebesar ``(xstep, ystep)``\\ . Piksel yang digeser dari "
"luar buffer tidak dibersihkan, sehingga \"bayangan\" dari isi sebelumnya "
"mungkin tetap ada di tepi belakang."

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:145
msgid ""
"Draw another frame buffer ``fbuf`` on top of this one with its top-left "
"corner at ``(x, y)``."
msgstr ""
"Gambar buffer bingkai lain ``fbuf`` di atas yang ini dengan pojok kiri "
"atasnya pada ``(x, y)``\\ ."

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:148
msgid ""
"If ``key`` is given, any source pixel matching that colour value is treated "
"as transparent and not drawn. When a ``palette`` is provided, the comparison"
" is made against the palette output, not the raw ``fbuf`` value."
msgstr ""
"Jika ``key`` diberikan, piksel sumber mana pun yang cocok dengan nilai warna"
" tersebut diperlakukan sebagai transparan dan tidak digambar. Ketika "
"``palette`` disediakan, perbandingan dibuat terhadap output palette, bukan "
"nilai ``fbuf`` mentah."

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:153
msgid ""
"``fbuf`` can be a :class:`FrameBuffer` instance or a tuple/list matching the"
" constructor signature::"
msgstr ""
"``fbuf`` dapat berupa instans :class:`FrameBuffer` atau tuple/list yang "
"cocok dengan tanda tangan konstruktor::"

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:159
msgid "When the source is a tuple/list, ``buffer`` may be read-only."
msgstr ""
"Ketika sumbernya adalah tuple/list, ``buffer`` dapat bersifat read-only."

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:161
msgid ""
"``palette`` allows blitting between buffers of different formats -- for "
"example, rendering a monochrome glyph into an RGB565 buffer. It is a "
":class:`FrameBuffer` whose format matches the destination, with height 1 and"
" width equal to the number of source colours (``2**N`` for an N-bit-per-"
"pixel source). Source pixel value ``i`` is replaced with the colour at "
"``palette[i, 0]`` before drawing."
msgstr ""
"``palette`` memungkinkan blitting antara buffer dengan format berbeda -- "
"misalnya, merender glyph monokrom ke dalam buffer RGB565. Ini adalah "
":class:`FrameBuffer` yang formatnya cocok dengan tujuan, dengan tinggi 1 dan"
" lebar sama dengan jumlah warna sumber (\\ ``2**N`` untuk sumber N-bit-per-"
"piksel). Nilai piksel sumber ``i`` digantikan dengan warna pada ``palette[i,"
" 0]`` sebelum digambar."

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:171
msgid "Constants"
msgstr "Konstanta"

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:173
msgid ""
"The following ``format`` values are accepted by the constructor. The \"bytes"
" per pixel\" column is the multiplier needed when sizing the backing buffer."
msgstr ""
"Nilai ``format`` berikut diterima oleh konstruktor. Kolom \"byte per "
"piksel\" adalah pengali yang dibutuhkan saat menentukan ukuran buffer "
"backing."

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:181
msgid "Constant"
msgstr "Konstanta"

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:182
msgid "Bytes/pixel"
msgstr "Byte/piksel"

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:183
msgid "Pixel layout"
msgstr "Tata letak piksel"

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:184
msgid "``MONO_VLSB``"
msgstr "``MONO_VLSB``"

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:185 ../../library/framebuf.rst:190
#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:194
msgid "0.125"
msgstr "0.125"

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:186
msgid ""
"Monochrome (1-bit). Each byte holds 8 vertically-stacked pixels with bit 0 "
"nearest the top. Rows of 8 pixels advance left-to-right across the buffer, "
"then wrap to the next 8-pixel row."
msgstr ""
"Monokrom (1-bit). Setiap byte menampung 8 piksel yang ditumpuk secara "
"vertikal dengan bit 0 paling dekat dengan atas. Baris dari 8 piksel "
"melanjutkan kiri-ke-kanan melintasi buffer, kemudian membungkus ke baris 8 "
"piksel berikutnya."

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:189
msgid "``MONO_HLSB``"
msgstr "``MONO_HLSB``"

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:191
msgid ""
"Monochrome (1-bit). Each byte holds 8 horizontal pixels with bit 7 leftmost."
" Rows advance one pixel at a time vertically."
msgstr ""
"Monokrom (1-bit). Setiap byte menampung 8 piksel horizontal dengan bit 7 "
"paling kiri. Baris melanjutkan satu piksel sekaligus secara vertikal."

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:193
msgid "``MONO_HMSB``"
msgstr "``MONO_HMSB``"

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:195
msgid "Monochrome (1-bit). Like ``MONO_HLSB`` but with bit 0 leftmost."
msgstr ""
"Monokrom (1-bit). Seperti ``MONO_HLSB`` tetapi dengan bit 0 paling kiri."

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:196
msgid "``GS2_HMSB``"
msgstr "``GS2_HMSB``"

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:197
msgid "0.25"
msgstr "0.25"

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:198
msgid ""
"2-bit greyscale (4 levels), packed horizontally most-significant bit first."
msgstr ""
"Skala abu-abu 2-bit (4 level), dikemas secara horizontal dengan bit paling "
"signifikan terlebih dahulu."

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:200
msgid "``GS4_HMSB``"
msgstr "``GS4_HMSB``"

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:201
msgid "0.5"
msgstr "0.5"

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:202
msgid ""
"4-bit greyscale (16 levels), packed horizontally most-significant nibble "
"first."
msgstr ""
"Skala abu-abu 4-bit (16 level), dikemas secara horizontal dengan nibble "
"paling signifikan terlebih dahulu."

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:204
msgid "``GS8``"
msgstr "``GS8``"

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:205
msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:206
msgid "8-bit greyscale (256 levels)."
msgstr "Skala abu-abu 8-bit (256 level)."

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:207
msgid "``RGB565``"
msgstr "``RGB565``"

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:208
msgid "2"
msgstr "2"

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:209
msgid "16-bit RGB with 5 red, 6 green and 5 blue bits."
msgstr "RGB 16-bit dengan 5 bit merah, 6 bit hijau, dan 5 bit biru."

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:211
msgid ""
"``framebuf.MVLSB`` is a deprecated alias for ``framebuf.MONO_VLSB``; prefer "
"the latter in new code."
msgstr ""
"``framebuf.MVLSB`` adalah alias yang sudah usang untuk "
"``framebuf.MONO_VLSB``\\ ; lebih suka gunakan yang terakhir dalam kode baru."

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:215
msgid "Legacy constructor"
msgstr "Konstruktor lama"

#: ../../library/framebuf.rst:219
msgid ""
"Deprecated shortcut for ``FrameBuffer(buffer, width, height, "
"framebuf.MONO_VLSB, stride)``. Retained for backwards compatibility; use the"
" full :class:`FrameBuffer` constructor instead."
msgstr ""
"Pintasan yang sudah usang untuk ``FrameBuffer(buffer, width, height, "
"framebuf.MONO_VLSB, stride)``\\ . Dipertahankan untuk kompatibilitas mundur;"
" gunakan konstruktor :class:`FrameBuffer` lengkap sebagai gantinya."
